cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository or its dataset, please cite the survey below."
title: "Knowledge Graphs in Manufacturing — Literature Database, Catalogs & Benchmark"
abstract: >-
  An open, machine-readable database and catalog for research on knowledge graphs in
  manufacturing (Industry 4.0/5.0, digital twins, manufacturing ontologies, predictive
  maintenance and semantic interoperability), accompanying the peer-reviewed survey
  "Examining the Adoption of Knowledge Graphs in the Manufacturing Industry: A
  Comprehensive Review".
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Martinez-Gil
    given-names: Jorge
    affiliation: Software Competence Center Hagenberg (SCCH), Austria
repository-code: "https://github.com/jorge-martinez-gil/knowledge-graphs-manufacturing"
url: "https://jorge-martinez-gil.github.io/knowledge-graphs-manufacturing/"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - knowledge graphs
  - manufacturing
  - Industry 4.0
  - Industry 5.0
  - digital twin
  - manufacturing ontology
  - semantic interoperability
  - smart manufacturing
